OL,3,ATrump says 'threat' led US to pull
OL,4,Abombers from RAF Fairford
OL,5,
OL,6,FPresident Donald Trump has said the US
OL,7,Fmoved its bombers out of RAF Fairford
OL,8,Fbecause of "some threats" to the base.
OL,10,FThe Pentagon confirmed on Sunday it had
OL,11,Fremoved its bombers - thought to be
OL,12,Fabout a dozen B-1s - from the base back
OL,13,Fto their home stations in America.
OL,15,FSpeaking to reporters as he departed
OL,16,Ffor Nebraska on Monday, Trump said the
OL,17,FUS had known of a "threat", which led
OL,18,Fthem to move the bombers.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
